                <p class="meta">Last Updated: August 2026</p>
                <p>Welcome to UBR Esports. By participating in tournaments, using the wallet system, or accessing this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms.</p>

                <h3>1. Acceptance & Fair Play</h3>
                <p>All participants agree to uphold principles of competitive integrity. Any form of hacking, emulation on mobile-only lobbies, teaming up with rivals, or glitch exploitation will result in immediate disqualification and account ban.</p>

                <h3>2. Eligibility & Registration</h3>
                <p>Players must provide valid BGMI in-game IDs and registered WhatsApp contact numbers during tournament registrations to receive slot confirmations and room IDs/passwords.</p>

                <h3>3. Wallet & Prize Withdrawals</h3>
