                <h3>5. Contact for Tournament Disputes</h3>
                <p>For any match dispute, prize query, or rule clarification, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:ubresport@gmail.com">ubresport@gmail.com</a> or via WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/917880892513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+91 7880892513</a>.</p>
